1
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:03,700
This is Voxura.

2
00:00:03,700 --> 00:00:08,220
An AI calling platform that helps businesses reach every lead,

3
00:00:08,220 --> 00:00:12,680
in their own language, and turn conversations into customers.

4
00:00:14,480 --> 00:00:17,530
Every business faces the same problem.

5
00:00:17,530 --> 00:00:19,930
Leads arrive from many places.

6
00:00:19,930 --> 00:00:22,260
Calling each one takes hours.

7
00:00:22,260 --> 00:00:24,590
And follow-ups get forgotten.

8
00:00:24,590 --> 00:00:28,600
Voxura brings all of it into one connected system.

9
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:36,040
From the customer's side, Voxura works in six simple steps.

10
00:00:36,040 --> 00:00:37,180
Set up once.

11
00:00:37,180 --> 00:00:38,620
Add your leads.

12
00:00:38,620 --> 00:00:40,240
Start a campaign.

13
00:00:40,240 --> 00:00:42,340
Let the AI agent call.

14
00:00:42,340 --> 00:00:43,300
Follow up.

15
00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:45,310
And win the customer.

16
00:00:47,110 --> 00:00:50,160
Behind these six steps are two flows.

17
00:00:50,160 --> 00:00:52,880
The setup flow is done only once.

18
00:00:52,880 --> 00:00:55,600
The daily flow repeats every day.

19
00:00:55,600 --> 00:00:58,740
Let's walk through both, step by step.

20
00:01:00,540 --> 00:01:03,290
First, the setup flow.

21
00:01:05,090 --> 00:01:05,750
Step one.

22
00:01:05,750 --> 00:01:08,150
The business creates its account.

23
00:01:08,150 --> 00:01:12,740
It enters the company name, the owner's details and a password.

24
00:01:12,740 --> 00:01:16,530
Voxura creates a private workspace for that company,

25
00:01:16,530 --> 00:01:19,880
and the person who signs up becomes the owner.

26
00:01:19,880 --> 00:01:22,580
Every company sees only its own data.

27
00:01:24,380 --> 00:01:25,030
Step two.

28
00:01:25,030 --> 00:01:26,780
Add money to the wallet.

29
00:01:26,780 --> 00:01:28,090
Voxura is prepaid.

30
00:01:28,090 --> 00:01:32,300
Every top-up and every call charge is written to a ledger,

31
00:01:32,300 --> 00:01:35,350
so the balance always matches the history.

32
00:01:35,350 --> 00:01:39,790
A low-balance alert warns the team before the money runs out.

33
00:01:39,790 --> 00:01:43,270
Online payment will be connected before go-live.

34
00:01:45,070 --> 00:01:45,850
Step three.

35
00:01:45,850 --> 00:01:47,840
Get a business phone number.

36
00:01:47,840 --> 00:01:53,230
Voxura's team adds numbers to a central pool and assigns one to the company.

37
00:01:53,230 --> 00:01:58,270
The company then sees its lines, the monthly rent and the renewal date,

38
00:01:58,270 --> 00:02:01,810
and chooses which AI agent answers incoming calls.

39
00:02:03,610 --> 00:02:04,350
Step four.

40
00:02:04,350 --> 00:02:06,280
Add services and products.

41
00:02:06,280 --> 00:02:11,550
For each one, the business decides what the AI may say about the price,

42
00:02:11,550 --> 00:02:15,330
when to offer it, and what the next step should be,

43
00:02:15,330 --> 00:02:17,040
such as booking a demo.

44
00:02:18,840 --> 00:02:19,620
Step five.

45
00:02:19,620 --> 00:02:22,760
Create the AI agent, in six short steps.

46
00:02:22,760 --> 00:02:25,030
Give it a name and a purpose.

47
00:02:25,030 --> 00:02:26,990
Write what it should say.

48
00:02:26,990 --> 00:02:28,870
Choose what it may sell.

49
00:02:28,870 --> 00:02:32,240
Add company knowledge and common questions.

50
00:02:32,240 --> 00:02:36,010
Pick one of eleven Indian languages and a voice.

51
00:02:36,010 --> 00:02:39,770
Then set options like call recording and memory.

52
00:02:41,570 --> 00:02:45,000
Steps six and seven are designed, and come next.

53
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:48,280
The owner will invite team members with roles,

54
00:02:48,280 --> 00:02:52,000
and connect lead sources like the website, Facebook,

55
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:56,640
Google Ads and IndiaMART, so that new leads arrive automatically.

56
00:02:58,440 --> 00:03:03,160
With setup complete, the AI agent is ready to start calling.

57
00:03:04,960 --> 00:03:06,710
Now, the daily flow.

58
00:03:06,710 --> 00:03:09,950
This is what the team does every day.

59
00:03:11,750 --> 00:03:14,020
The day starts on the dashboard.

60
00:03:14,020 --> 00:03:18,630
In one view, the team sees the wallet balance, calls and minutes,

61
00:03:18,630 --> 00:03:23,240
the running campaign, and the follow-ups that are due or overdue.

62
00:03:23,240 --> 00:03:26,640
Every figure opens the full page with one click.

63
00:03:28,440 --> 00:03:30,120
Next, leads are added.

64
00:03:30,120 --> 00:03:31,720
When a lead is saved,

65
00:03:31,720 --> 00:03:37,660
Voxura cleans the phone number into one standard format and blocks duplicates.

66
00:03:37,660 --> 00:03:43,370
Each lead then moves across six stages, from New to Won, on a simple board.

67
00:03:45,170 --> 00:03:49,060
Thousands of leads can be imported from Excel at once.

68
00:03:49,060 --> 00:03:53,160
Voxura finds the right columns, shows a preview of valid,

69
00:03:53,160 --> 00:03:57,830
invalid and repeated rows, and never overwrites an existing lead.

70
00:03:57,830 --> 00:04:01,500
One click then sends the new leads into a campaign.

71
00:04:03,300 --> 00:04:05,280
Then a campaign is created.

72
00:04:05,280 --> 00:04:11,020
The team picks the AI agent, and chooses who to call, by stage, city or owner.

73
00:04:11,020 --> 00:04:14,990
Voxura instantly shows how many people will be called,

74
00:04:14,990 --> 00:04:18,880
the estimated cost, and whether the wallet is enough.

75
00:04:18,880 --> 00:04:22,260
Do-not-disturb numbers are skipped by default.

76
00:04:24,060 --> 00:04:28,130
The team sets the start time, the daily calling hours,

77
00:04:28,130 --> 00:04:32,430
how many calls run at once, and how many retries to make.

78
00:04:32,430 --> 00:04:36,500
A campaign moves from draft, to scheduled, to running,

79
00:04:36,500 --> 00:04:38,380
and finally to completed.

80
00:04:38,380 --> 00:04:42,450
It can be paused, restarted, or cancelled at any time.

81
00:04:44,250 --> 00:04:46,090
Now the AI makes the call.

82
00:04:46,090 --> 00:04:50,410
Before dialling, it checks the calling hours, do-not-disturb,

83
00:04:50,410 --> 00:04:52,600
the wallet, and the call limit.

84
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:55,510
During the call, it listens, understands,

85
00:04:55,510 --> 00:04:57,990
and replies in the chosen language,

86
00:04:57,990 --> 00:05:01,240
using only the company's approved information.

87
00:05:01,240 --> 00:05:06,270
After the call, it saves the recording, the transcript and the outcome,

88
00:05:06,270 --> 00:05:08,180
charges the talk time once,

89
00:05:08,180 --> 00:05:11,440
and schedules a retry or a callback if needed.

90
00:05:11,440 --> 00:05:14,980
This live voice connection is the next build step,

91
00:05:14,980 --> 00:05:17,600
once the provider accounts are ready.

92
00:05:19,400 --> 00:05:24,110
Every call appears in call history, with names instead of codes.

93
00:05:24,110 --> 00:05:28,750
Opening a call shows the result, the summary, the conversation,

94
00:05:28,750 --> 00:05:30,590
and exactly what it cost.

95
00:05:30,590 --> 00:05:33,160
Unanswered calls are never charged.

96
00:05:34,960 --> 00:05:37,920
Follow-ups make sure no lead is forgotten.

97
00:05:37,920 --> 00:05:41,030
A follow-up can be a task for a team member,

98
00:05:41,030 --> 00:05:43,570
or a callback that the AI will make.

99
00:05:43,570 --> 00:05:47,030
They are sorted into overdue, today and upcoming,

100
00:05:47,030 --> 00:05:49,780
and late items appear on the dashboard.

101
00:05:51,580 --> 00:05:56,130
Finally, the team moves the lead forward, stage by stage,

102
00:05:56,130 --> 00:05:58,200
until the customer is won.

103
00:05:58,200 --> 00:06:01,480
And the next day, the cycle begins again.

104
00:06:03,280 --> 00:06:07,500
Behind every screen, business rules run automatically.

105
00:06:07,500 --> 00:06:09,530
Phone numbers are cleaned.

106
00:06:09,530 --> 00:06:11,330
Duplicates are blocked.

107
00:06:11,330 --> 00:06:13,520
Do-not-disturb is respected.

108
00:06:13,520 --> 00:06:16,880
Costs are checked before a campaign starts.

109
00:06:16,880 --> 00:06:19,300
Each call is charged only once.

110
00:06:19,300 --> 00:06:22,350
And every company's data stays private.

111
00:06:22,350 --> 00:06:28,450
Scheduled automation, such as reminders and emails, comes with the next phase.

112
00:06:30,250 --> 00:06:32,490
Access is controlled by role.

113
00:06:32,490 --> 00:06:36,600
Owners and admins manage agents, campaigns and money.

114
00:06:36,600 --> 00:06:39,070
Staff work with leads and tasks.

115
00:06:39,070 --> 00:06:43,950
These rules are checked on the server, for every single action.

116
00:06:45,750 --> 00:06:49,970
Voxura's own team runs the platform from the Super Admin.

117
00:06:49,970 --> 00:06:54,410
It is designed to manage client companies, plans and prices,

118
00:06:54,410 --> 00:06:58,700
wallets with a second approval, provider costs and margin,

119
00:06:58,700 --> 00:07:00,550
and a complete audit log.

120
00:07:00,550 --> 00:07:03,430
The phone number pool is already built.

121
00:07:05,230 --> 00:07:08,430
So far, twelve modules are built and working,

122
00:07:08,430 --> 00:07:10,500
covering forty-two workflows,

123
00:07:10,500 --> 00:07:14,840
and verified by two hundred and eighty-five automated checks.

124
00:07:14,840 --> 00:07:19,040
Fifty-seven screens are designed for the complete platform.

125
00:07:20,840 --> 00:07:21,630
Voxura.

126
00:07:21,630 --> 00:07:25,230
Set up once, and grow every day.

